  "description": "<i>Note: Unaired episode included in the first Blu-ray volume.</i>\n<br><br>\nIt's a special episode of Season Two and listed as the 13th episode of it, it was part of the Blu-ray boxset for Season Two. \n<br><br>\nDuring a break in their journey, Shia asks Yue, who is skilled at magic, to teach her the tricks of magic. Tio and Myu wanted to join as well, but Hajime tries to stop them for some reason. Then Yue’s magic class begins. After that, Hajime and his friends decide to take a detour. they arrived to a town lined with many clothing stores, and they decide to buy some clothes that Myu likes. But what starts there is not shopping, but a clothing exchange between each other.",
